{"key":"moonbitlang/x/encoding.encode_to","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/encoding","name":"encode_to","parent":"moonbitlang/x/encoding","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn encode_to(String, @buffer.Buffer, encoding~ : Encoding) -> Unit","doc":"Encodes a string into the specified character encoding and writes the result\n directly into a buffer.\n\n Parameters:\n\n * `string` : The input string to be encoded.\n * `buffer` : The buffer where the encoded bytes will be written to.\n * `encoding` : The target encoding format. Defaults to UTF8 if not specified.\n\n Example:\n\n ```moonbit check\n test {\n   let buf = Buffer()\n   let text = \"Hello, world\"\n   @encoding.encode_to(text, buf, encoding=UTF16)\n   inspect(buf.to_string(), content=\"Hello, world\")\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
