{"key":"moonbitlang/x/rational.Rational.div:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/rational","name":"div","parent":"moonbitlang/x/rational.Rational","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T : Integral] Rational::div(Self[T], Self[T]) -> Self[T]","doc":"Divides one rational number by another.\n\n Parameters:\n\n * `self` : The dividend rational number.\n * `other` : The divisor rational number.\n\n Returns the quotient of the division as a rational number.\n\n Example:\n\n ```moonbit check\n test {\n   let a = @rational.new(1L, 2L) // 1/2\n   let b = @rational.new(2L, 3L) // 2/3\n   match (a, b) {\n     (Some(x), Some(y)) => {\n       let result = x / y // 3/4\n       inspect(result, content=\"3/4\")\n     }\n     _ => ()\n   }\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
