{"key":"moonbitlang/x/path.Path.basename:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/path","name":"basename","parent":"moonbitlang/x/path.Path","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn Path::basename(Self) -> StringView","doc":"Returns the last path component of the given path.\n\n property: `@path.join(@path.dirname(path), @path.basename(path)) == path`\n \n Warning: basename function not respect this POSIX standard, but consistent with Python `os.path` module.\n \n ```moonbit skip nocheck\n let path : Path = \"usr/local/bin\"\n inspect(path.basename(), content=\"bin\")\n ```","attrs":[]}
