{"key":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack.drop:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/stack","name":"drop","parent":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Stack::drop(Self[T]) -> Unit","doc":"Drop the element at the top of the stack.\n Like pop, but does not return elements and does nothing if the Stack is empty.\n\n # Example\n\n ```\n   let s = @stack.of([1, 2, 3])\n   s.drop()\n   assert_eq(s.length(), 2)\n ```","attrs":[]}
