{"key":"moonbitlang/x/path/win32.Path.join:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/path/win32","name":"join","parent":"moonbitlang/x/path/win32.Path","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn Path::join(Self, Self) -> Self","doc":"1. string concatenation with OS platform specific path separator\n 2. if rhs is absolute or on a different drive, return rhs\n \n edge cases:\n  1. when lhs and rhs both are empty, return empty string\n  2. ignore empty string\n \n ```moonbit check\n test {\n   let path1 : Path = \"C::\\\\Program Files\"\n   let path2 : Path = \"App\"\n   inspect(path1.join(path2), content=\"C::\\\\Program Files\\\\App\")\n }\n ```","attrs":[]}
