{"key":"moonbitlang/x/crypto.ChaCha.chacha12:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/crypto","name":"chacha12","parent":"moonbitlang/x/crypto.ChaCha","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[K : ByteSource, N : ByteSource] ChaCha::chacha12(K, N, counter? : UInt) -> Self raise","doc":"Creates a ChaCha12 encryption context following the RFC 8439 standard.\n - [key] must be 256-bit (32 bytes), in little-endian order.\n - [nonce] must be a 96-bit (12 bytes) bytes, in little-endian order.\n - [counter] is the counter value, defaulting to 0.\n\n raise Error if the length of key or nonce is invalid.","attrs":[]}
