{"key":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack.drop_result:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/stack","name":"drop_result","parent":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Stack::drop_result(Self[T]) -> Result[Unit, Unit]","doc":"Drop the element at the top of the stack.\n Like drop, but when the drop is successful, it returns `Ok(())`, and when it fails, it returns `Err(())`\n\n # Example\n\n ```\n   let s = @stack.of([1, 2, 3])\n   let r = s.drop_result() // Ok(())\n   assert_eq(r, Ok(()))\n ```","attrs":[]}
