{"key":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack.each:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/stack","name":"each","parent":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Stack::each(Self[T], (T) -> Unit) -> Unit","doc":"Iterates over the elements of the stack from top to bottom.\n \n # Example\n ```\n   let s = @stack.of([1, 2, 3])\n   let mut sum = 0\n   s.each(fn(i) { sum = sum + i })\n   assert_eq(sum, 6)\n ```","attrs":[]}
