{"key":"moonbitlang/x/crypto.hmac","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/crypto","name":"hmac","parent":"moonbitlang/x/crypto","kind":"function","sig_":"pub fn[H : CryptoHasher] hmac(H, BytesView, BytesView) -> FixedArray[Byte]","doc":"Computes HMAC (Hash-based Message Authentication Code) using a specified\n cryptographic hash function.\n\n Parameters:\n\n * `hash` : A hash function implementation that satisfies the `CryptoHasher`\n trait.\n * `key` : The secret key used for generating the authentication code.\n * `message` : The message to be authenticated.\n\n Returns a fixed-size array of bytes containing the HMAC value. The length of\n the output depends on the underlying hash function's output size.","attrs":[]}
