{"key":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack.fold:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/stack","name":"fold","parent":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T, U] Stack::fold(Self[T], init~ : U, (U, T) -> U) -> U","doc":"Folds over the elements of the stack from top to bottom.\n \n # Example\n ```\n   let s = @stack.of([1, 2, 3])\n   let sum = s.fold(init=0, fn(acc, i) { acc + i })\n   assert_eq(sum, 6)\n ```","attrs":[]}
