{"key":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack.pop:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/stack","name":"pop","parent":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Stack::pop(Self[T]) -> T?","doc":"Pop an element from the top of the stack.\n If there are elements in the stack, return `Some (the top element of the stack)`, otherwise return `None`.\n\n # Example\n\n ```\n   let s = @stack.of([1, 2, 3])\n   let s1 : Stack[Int] = @stack.new()\n   assert_eq(s.pop(), Some(1))\n   assert_eq(s.length(), 2)\n   assert_eq(s1.pop(), None)\n ```","attrs":[]}
