{"key":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack.unsafe_pop:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/stack","name":"unsafe_pop","parent":"moonbitlang/x/stack.Stack","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn[T] Stack::unsafe_pop(Self[T]) -> T","doc":"Pop an element from the top of the stack.\n If there are elements in the stack, return the top element of the stack, otherwise abort.\n\n @alert unsafe \"Panic if the stack is empty.\"","attrs":[]}
