{"key":"moonbitlang/x/path/win32.Path.resolve:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/path/win32","name":"resolve","parent":"moonbitlang/x/path/win32.Path","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn Path::resolve(Self) -> Self","doc":"1. if path is absolute, return path normalized.\n 2. if path is relative, join current working directory and path, and then normalize it.\n\n Warning: cwd is already resolve symbolic link and normalized, but path doesn't.\n \n ```moonbit skip nocheck\n let path : Path = \"Documents\\\\Project\"\n inspect(path.resolve(), content=\"C:\\\\your\\\\current_working_directory\\\\Documents\\\\Project\")\n ```","attrs":[]}
{"key":"moonbitlang/x/time.ZoneOffset.seconds:Method","pkg":"moonbitlang/x/time","name":"seconds","parent":"moonbitlang/x/time.ZoneOffset","kind":"method","sig_":"pub fn ZoneOffset::seconds(Self) -> Int","doc":"Returns the total seconds of this offset.","attrs":[]}
